#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:5
#: .\templates\includes\layout\navbar.html:28
#: .\templates\includes\layout\navbar.html:31
#: .\templates\includes\layout\navbar.html:219
#: .\templates\includes\layout\navbar.html:226 .\templates\pages\home.html:342
msgid "Cómo funciona"
msgstr "How it works"

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:6
msgid "Reserva con contexto. Gestiona sin caos."
msgstr "Book with context. Manage without chaos."

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:8
msgid ""
"\n"
"          Aquí no vas a ciegas: ves <span class=\"font-semibold u-text\">qué "
"incluye</span>,\n"
"          <span class=\"font-semibold u-text\">cómo será</span> y\n"
"          <span class=\"font-semibold u-text\">en qué punto está</span> tu "
"solicitud en todo momento.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          You never book blindly: see <span class=\"font-semibold u-"
"text\">what’s included</span>,\n"
"          <span class=\"font-semibold u-text\">what to expect</span>, and\n"
"          <span class=\"font-semibold u-text\">the exact status</span> of "
"your request at all times.\n"
"        "

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:17
msgid "Paso 1"
msgstr "Step 1"

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:17
msgid "Explora con criterio"
msgstr "Explore with clarity"

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:17
msgid ""
"Filtra por tipo de plan, idioma, dificultad y duración. Cada experiencia "
"viene con detalles reales (qué llevar, punto de encuentro, reglas)."
msgstr ""
"Filter by plan type, language, difficulty, and duration. Each experience "
"includes real details (what to bring, meeting point, rules)."

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:18
msgid "Paso 2"
msgstr "Step 2"

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:18
msgid "Solicita tu fecha"
msgstr "Request your date"

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:18
msgid ""
"Envías una <span class=\"font-semibold u-text\">solicitud</span> con grupo, "
"preferencias y notas. Nada de “te confirmo por WhatsApp”: queda todo "
"registrado desde el minuto 1."
msgstr ""
"Send a <span class=\"font-semibold u-text\">request</span> with group size, "
"preferences, and notes. No “I’ll confirm on WhatsApp” — everything is "
"recorded from minute one."

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:19
msgid "Paso 3"
msgstr "Step 3"

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:19
msgid "Estado claro (sin dudas)"
msgstr "Clear status (no confusion)"

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:19
msgid ""
"El guía revisa solicitud. Tú ves el estado: <span class=\"font-semibold u-"
"text\">pendiente → aceptada</span>. Cambios y mensajes quedan con "
"trazabilidad."
msgstr ""
"The guide reviews your request. You see the status: <span class=\"font-"
"semibold u-text\">pending → accepted</span>. Changes and messages remain "
"traceable."

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:20
msgid "Paso 4"
msgstr "Step 4"

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:20
msgid "Vive y valida"
msgstr "Experience it & review"

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:20
msgid ""
"Después, dejas tu reseña. Solo cuentan opiniones de <span class=\"font-"
"semibold u-text\">reservas reales</span>: más confianza para los siguientes "
"viajeros."
msgstr ""
"Afterwards, leave your review. Only feedback from <span class=\"font-"
"semibold u-text\">real bookings</span> counts, building trust for future "
"travelers."

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:22
msgid "Resultado: menos incertidumbre para viajeros y más control para guías."
msgstr "Result: less uncertainty for travelers and more control for guides."

